a declared argument type is answered by the declared result type
UInt32
a Dynamic argument keeps that result type, made nullable for the null such a row may hold
Nullable(UInt32)	1
and a null row still answers NULL without reaching the guest
\N
a result type that cannot be inside Nullable keeps the Dynamic result, null included
Dynamic	\N
a result type that is already Nullable carries the null itself and is not nested
Nullable(UInt32)	1	\N
